      "dc:source": "australian-border-force-amendment-protected-information-act-2017.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies in relation to the making of a record, or a disclosure,\nof protected information if the record or disclosure was made:\n\n(a) on or after 1 July 2015; and\n\n(b) before the day this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies in relation to the making of a record, or a disclosure,\nof protected information if the record or disclosure was made:\n\n(a) on or after 1 July 2015; and\n\n(b) before the day this Act receives the Royal Assent.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-border-force-amendment-protected-information-act-2017-sch-1-sec-25-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "93cb00959df81077908af2638ad1d77d1f7fbc11b9b794921898070056b58453",
      "skos:note": "Interaction with Privacy Act for records and disclosures made on or after July 1, 2015, before the day this Act receives Royal Assent."
    },
